+
+## Fixed
+
+- Updated the inherited BP-036 runtime fixture to match the source-correct C-runtime `atoi` behavior introduced by BP-076.
+- `0x20` and `'A` now correctly produce zero in the downstream `V_cshift_f` regression test.
